    <string name="dev_link_title">Haɗin masu haɓakawa</string>
    <string name="dev_link_body">Yana jera mashigan talabijin da dukkan manhajojinsa, yana sauya mashiga a talabijin da ke ƙin maɓallan HDMI, kuma yana daidaita haske a wasu. Yana aiki ta haɗin gyara kurakurai na talabijin (ADB). Maɓallai da rubutu suna aiki iri ɗaya ba tare da shi ba.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_developer">A talabijin, buɗe Settings › System › About sannan zaɓi Android TV OS build sau bakwai. A tsofaffin talabijin, Device Preferences › About › Build ne.</string>
