    <string name="dev_link_away_short">Ba ya amsawa</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off">Talabijin ya ƙi haɗin. Tabbatar USB debugging na kunne. Tun daga Android TV 14 wasu talabijin suna karɓar Wireless debugging kawai, wanda TennaRC ba zai iya amfani da shi ba tukuna.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off_short">Debugging a kashe yake a talabijin</string>
    <string name="dev_link_wireless">Wireless debugging kaɗai ke kunne, wanda TennaRC ba zai iya amfani da shi ba tukuna. Kunna USB debugging ma, ko ka haɗa daga kwamfuta sau ɗaya ka gudanar da adb tcpip 5555, wanda zai ɗore har talabijin ya sake farawa.</string>
